# ApexStrategy Enterprise — Environment Variables
# ====================================================
# This app is 100% client-side. No environment variables are required.
#
# The simulation engine runs entirely in the browser. Auth credentials
# and game state are stored in the user's localStorage. Exchange rates
# are fetched at runtime from the free open.er-api.com public API.
#
# If you want to use Prisma + a database for server-side features later,
# uncomment the line below and set your database URL:
# DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
